  "result": "**What it does:** Order utilities — `calcTotal` sums item price×qty, `applyDiscount` applies a percentage code, `averageItemPrice` averages, `formatOrder` renders a receipt string with discounted total.\n\n**Bugs:**\n1. `calcTotal:5` — off-by-one: `i <= items.length` reads `items[length]` (undefined) → `undefined.price` throws `TypeError`. Use `i < items.length`.\n2. `averageItemPrice:20` — divides by `items.length` with no empty-array guard → `NaN` (0/0) on empty input.\n3. `applyDiscount:13` — code lookup is case-sensitive and unvalidated; also no clamp/guard on negative totals (minor, depending on intent).\n\nBug #1 is the crash — everything routing through `calcTotal` fails on non-empty arrays.",
